    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0068_8414f1865fe3.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Gatterman Koch reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0068_b925802a875c.png\" style=\"width: 269px; height: 50px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Etard reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0068_6a9245af4a24.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Stephen reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0068_cbee445e6f04.png\" style=\"width: 249px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Rosenmund reaction</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
